  "tags": [
    "Equipment",
    "Voltron",
    "Legends",
    "Big power"
  ],
  "strategy": "Cloud, Ex-SOLDIER grabs an Equipment as it enters and draws a card for each equipped creature that attacks beside it, making two Treasures whenever it swings with power 7 or greater. The deck is built to suit everyone up and reach that number: Puresteel Paladin, Armory Automaton, Cid, Freeflier Pilot and Helitrooper make Equipment cheap to cast and move, Colossus Hammer, Wrecking Ball Arm, Summoning Materia and Conformer Shuriken turn any body into a threat, and Barret Wallace, Red XIII, Proud Warrior and Sephiroth, Fallen Hero reward a board of equipped and modified creatures. Bugenhagen, Wise Elder and Tifa, Martial Artist pay off a creature with power 7 or greater and Furious Rise one with power 4 or greater, Hellkite Tyrant and Yuffie, Materia Hunter take the opponents' artifacts, and Cloud's Limit Break, Austere Command, Vanquish the Horde and Ultimate Magic: Meteor clear the way.",
